# Force LF for source files regardless of platform or local git config.
# Without this, sourcesContent embedded in generated source maps
# (python/dash-fluida's bundle in particular) can differ byte-for-byte
# between a checkout that applied CRLF and one that didn't, even when
# nothing about the actual source changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
